            <title>[IGNITE-5225] TcpCommunicationSpi.createTcpClient can cause OOME.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5225</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;TcpCommunicationSpi.filterReachable method doesn&apos;t shutdown executor correctly that causes OOME.&lt;br/&gt;
